Modifications made since the fork (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)):
- Renamed to "Agent Lens"; new icon set.
- Removed the telemetry endpoint inherited from the original project;
  Agent Lens sends no telemetry.
- Accessibility, keyboard, contrast, focus and reduced-motion improvements across
  the web UI; accessible alternatives for the canvas graph and the timeline.
- Hardened the hook server and event relay against untrusted input and
  resource exhaustion; full subagent prompt and report in extension events.
- Automated accessibility tests (jsx-a11y lint, axe-core) and CI steps.

"Agent Flow" is the name of the original project. Agent Lens is an independent
project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by its maintainers.
